000194389625000027/0001943896-25-000027-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-03-13","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389625000006/0001943896-25-000006-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-12-05","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389624000025/0001943896-24-000025-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-09-09","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389624000014/0001943896-24-000014-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[],"summary":{"sentences":["Rubrik, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 1 year.","It reported $1.3bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 39.0% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 80.5%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($72.5m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 39.0% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $387.1m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 7 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Gross margin of 80.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 78.3% to 80.5% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $72.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Net cash of $106.6m against total assets of $2.8bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-13.6% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 6.3% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$481.3m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 7.2% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (103,536 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000202022026000018/0002020220-26-000018-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.7% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000202022026000018/0002020220-26-000018-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 73.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.73,"consecutive":2,"current":0.805,"current_display":"80.5%","threshold_display":"73.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 19.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.19,"consecutive":2,"current":0.39,"current_display":"39.0%","threshold_display":"19.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 13.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.13,"consecutive":1,"current":0.063,"current_display":"6.3%","threshold_display":"13.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"going_concern","